  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 3 is the longest at Johnny Roberts at 273 feet — still a par 3, still short, but the mature trees make it the one hole where accuracy fully decides the score. It's the perfect summary of a course that has been teaching Arvada players their lines since 1978.",
  "localTips": "Bring a putter and a midrange — that's the whole bag you need. Free to play, restrooms on site, and very cart friendly. Olde Town Arvada is a 5-minute drive for food after the round; weekday mornings are the quiet window.",
